  m_Name: Text_QuarryWorker_SouthFace_Men
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: 'Gone up to the fort, they told us. Better work, better food. Funny thing, though: I carry stone up to that fort every week, and I''ve never once seen any of them up there.'
